const clone=value=>structuredClone(value??{}),esc=value=>String(value??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
const iso=date=>`${date.getFullYear()}-${String(date.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0')}-${String(date.getDate()).padStart(2,'0')}`,date=value=>new Date(value+'T12:00:00'),validDate=value=>/^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/.test(value||'')&&Number.isFinite(+date(value))&&iso(date(value))===value,validTime=value=>/^([01]\d|2[0-3]):[0-5]\d$/.test(value||'');
